Privacy Policy
This Privacy Policy applies to the Memory Match app (hereafter referred to as the “Application”) for mobile devices, created by Deepak P (hereafter referred to as the “Service Provider”). The Application is provided as a free service and is intended to be used “AS IS.”
Information Collection and Use
The Memory Match Application does not require users to create an account and does not directly collect, store, or share personally identifiable information.
The Application does not request access to contacts, location, camera, microphone, or other sensitive device permissions.
The Application may store certain game-related information locally on the user's device, such as:
- Current game level
- Completed levels
- Game scores
- Stars or other game progress
- Other gameplay preferences or progress required for the Application to function
This information is stored locally on the user's device and is not directly transmitted to or collected by the Service Provider.
Advertising
The Application may display advertisements provided by third-party advertising services such as Google AdMob.
Advertising providers may automatically collect certain information from the device, such as advertising identifiers, device information, approximate location, and information about interactions with advertisements, in accordance with their own privacy policies and applicable laws.
The Service Provider does not directly collect or control information collected by third-party advertising providers.
