Third-Party Services
The Application may use third-party services, including Google AdMob, to provide advertisements.
These third-party services may collect information according to their own privacy policies. Users are encouraged to review the privacy policies of these services for more information about their data practices.
Children's Privacy
The Application does not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children.
Because the Application does not require users to create an account or directly submit personal information, the Service Provider does not knowingly collect personal information from children through the Application.
If advertising services are enabled, advertisements and associated data practices are governed by the policies and age-related requirements of the applicable advertising provider.
Data Security
The Service Provider does not directly collect or transmit users' personal information through the Application.
Game progress stored locally on the device remains on the device unless the user removes the Application or clears its application data.
The Service Provider cannot guarantee the security of information handled by third-party services, and users should refer to the privacy policies of those services for details.
Data Deletion
Since the Application does not require a user account and game progress is stored locally on the device, users can generally remove locally stored Application data by uninstalling the Application or clearing its data through their device settings.
Information that may be collected by third-party advertising services is subject to the policies and controls provided by those services.
